{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32027","headline":"送刘侍御重使江西 · 贾岛","name":"送刘侍御重使江西","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"时当苦热远行人，石壁飞泉溅马身。\n又到锺陵知务大，还浮湓浦属秋新。\n早程猨呌云深极，宿馆禽惊叶动频。\n前者已闻廉使荐，兼言有画静边尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32027.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32027","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}